Description: Details view, toolbar and status bar follow the DOT OS design system
 Text-only 40px rows divided by hairlines, mono capital column headers, kind
 as a capital label, size and date in the mono face. Details is the default
 view with Name, Kind, Size and Modified. The toolbar is Back, Forward, Up,
 the path, List, Grid, Search and the menu. The status bar is full width and
 set as a mono capital label. See design-system/boards/Files.dc.html.
Author: DOT OS project <maintainers@dot-os.invalid>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-14
